---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import styles from '../styles/legal.module.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | WitrQuran"
  description="WitrQuran is built with a simple principle: Your Quran listening experience should remain simple private and free from unnecessary tracking."
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class={styles.pageContainer}>
    <nav class={styles.breadcrumb} aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span>Privacy Policy</span>
    </nav>

    <header class={styles.header}>
      <h1 class={styles.title}>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class={styles.lastUpdated}>Last Updated: September 27, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class={styles.content}>
      <p>WitrQuran is built with a simple principle</p>

      <p><strong>Your Quran listening experience should remain simple private and free from unnecessary tracking</strong></p>

      <p>This Privacy Policy explains how WitrQuran handles information when you use our website.</p>

      <p>WitrQuran is an open source Quran listening platform created by <strong>Md Faruk Abdulla</strong></p>

      <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran is an independent open source Quran listening platform created and maintained by:</p>

      <p><strong>Md Faruk Abdulla</strong></p>

      <p>Email: <strong><a href="mailto:witrfaruk@proton.me">witrfaruk@proton.me</a></strong></p>

      <p>Website: <strong>https://witrquran.com</strong></p>

      <p>WitrQuran is designed to provide a simple fast and uninterrupted Quran listening experience.</p>

      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran does <strong>not require an account</strong> and does not ask you to provide personal information to listen to the Quran.</p>

      <p>We do not intentionally collect:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Your name</li>
        <li>Your email address for account creation</li>
        <li>Your phone number</li>
        <li>Your home address</li>
        <li>Your account credentials</li>
        <li>Your payment information</li>
        <li>Your personal profile</li>
        <li>Your listening history on our servers</li>
        <li>Your location for tracking purposes</li>
        <li>Advertising identifiers</li>
      </ul>

      <p>There is no registration or user account system on WitrQuran.</p>

      <h2>3. Listening Position</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran may store your listening position locally in your browser so that when you return you can continue listening from approximately where you previously stopped.</p>

      <p>This information is stored on <strong>your own device through browser local storage</strong> and is not stored by WitrQuran on a server.</p>

      <p>The stored listening position is retained for approximately <strong>six months</strong>.</p>

      <p>This functionality exists solely to provide the listening experience you requested.</p>

      <h2>4. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran does not use advertising cookies, analytics cookies, tracking cookies, or behavioral profiling technologies.</p>

      <p>Where technically necessary browser storage is used to provide requested functionality such as remembering your listening position, it is used only for that purpose.</p>

      <p>We do not use this information to:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Track you across websites</li>
        <li>Build advertising profiles</li>
        <li>Sell personal information</li>
        <li>Show targeted advertising</li>
        <li>Measure your behavior for advertising purposes</li>
      </ul>

      <p>Technically necessary storage may not require consent under applicable rules, but we provide this information so you understand what happens when you use WitrQuran.</p>

      <h2>5. Analytics and Tracking</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran does not use:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Google Analytics</li>
        <li>Microsoft Clarity</li>
        <li>Meta Pixel</li>
        <li>Advertising trackers</li>
        <li>Behavioral analytics platforms</li>
        <li>Cross-site tracking technologies</li>
      </ul>

      <p>We do not intentionally track how individual users interact with WitrQuran for advertising or profiling purposes.</p>

      <h2>6. Advertising</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran is completely free and does not display advertising.</p>

      <p>We do not use advertising networks or advertising trackers.</p>

      <p>Our goal is to provide an uninterrupted Quran listening experience without advertisements.</p>

      <h2>7. Third-Party Services</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran may rely on technical infrastructure and external services required to deliver the website and Quran audio.</p>

      <p>These services may technically process information necessary to deliver requests to your browser.</p>

      <p>Our website infrastructure includes services such as <strong>Cloudflare</strong> and <strong>Vercel</strong>.</p>

      <p>WitrQuran does not intentionally use these services to build advertising profiles or track users for marketing purposes.</p>

      <h2>8. Quran Audio</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran provides access to Quran recitation audio from a third-party source.</p>

      <p>WitrQuran does not claim ownership of the Quran or of third-party recitation recordings.</p>

      <p>The Quran is the Book of Almighty Allah SWT.</p>

      <p>WitrQuran is simply a platform created to make listening to the Quran easier for everyone by the will of Allah SWT.</p>

      <p>Information concerning content sources and rights is addressed further in our <strong>Copyright &amp; Content Policy</strong>.</p>

      <h2>9. Contacting Us</h2>

      <p>If you contact us directly by email, we will receive the information you choose to provide in your message.</p>

      <p>This may include:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Your email address</li>
        <li>Your name if you provide it</li>
        <li>The content of your message</li>
        <li>Any files or information you voluntarily include</li>
      </ul>

      <p>We use this information only to respond to your request and communicate with you regarding your inquiry.</p>

      <p>Email communications may be retained for as long as reasonably necessary to respond to or manage the inquiry.</p>

      <h2>10. Error Reports</h2>

      <p>If you report an error through our external reporting channel, the information you submit may be used to investigate and resolve the reported issue.</p>

      <p>We do not intend to permanently retain error-report information.</p>

      <p>Once the issue has been reviewed and resolved, the submitted information may be deleted.</p>

      <h2>11. Data Sharing</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran does not sell, rent, or trade personal information.</p>

      <p>We do not share personal information with advertisers or data brokers.</p>

      <p>Information may be processed by technical service providers when necessary to operate and deliver the website.</p>

      <h2>12. Data Security</h2>

      <p>We take reasonable measures to protect information that is processed through WitrQuran.</p>

      <p>However, no website or internet transmission can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>

      <p>Because WitrQuran does not operate user accounts or maintain a personal user database, the amount of personal information we intentionally collect is intentionally minimized.</p>

      <h2>13. Children's Privacy</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran does not require users to create accounts or submit personal information to use the service.</p>

      <p>We do not knowingly create profiles of children or intentionally collect children's personal information.</p>

      <h2>14. Your Privacy Rights</h2>

      <p>Depending on where you live, applicable privacy laws may provide you with rights concerning personal information.</p>

      <p>These may include rights to access, correct, delete, restrict, or object to certain processing of personal information.</p>

      <p>Because WitrQuran intentionally collects very little personal information, there may be little or no personal information held by us in response to such a request.</p>

      <p>For privacy-related requests, contact:</p>

      <p><strong><a href="mailto:witrfaruk@proton.me">witrfaruk@proton.me</a></strong></p>

      <h2>15. International Users</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran is available internationally.</p>

      <p>Technical requests may be processed through infrastructure operated by service providers in different countries.</p>

      <p>Where applicable, we will handle personal information in accordance with relevant data protection requirements.</p>

      <h2>16. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy when the WitrQuran website, technology, services, or applicable legal requirements change.</p>

      <p>When we make changes, we will update the <strong>Last Updated</strong> date at the beginning of this page.</p>

      <p>We encourage users to review this page periodically.</p>

      <h2>17. Contact</h2>

      <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how WitrQuran handles information, contact:</p>

      <p><strong>Md Faruk Abdulla</strong></p>

      <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:witrfaruk@proton.me">witrfaruk@proton.me</a></p>

      <p><strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/witrfaruk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://github.com/witrfaruk</a></p>

      <p>WitrQuran is an open source project created to make Quran listening simpler, faster, and free from unnecessary distractions.</p>

      <p><strong>The Quran is from Almighty Allah SWT. WitrQuran is simply a tool created to make listening easier for everyone by His will.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
